ostile-entity", "storyline": "You are an agent of The Reality Compliance Office (T.R.C.O.), a covert government division responsible for containing supernatural threats and unexplained anomalies. When a catastrophic rift in reality begins swallowing people, locations, and entire task forces, T.R.C.O launches a classified operation known as Project NOCLIP.\n\nMultiple agents have entered the breach.\n\nNone have returned.\n\nYou are the next agent sent into the anomaly \u2014 a distorted dimension filled with twisted environments, hostile creatures, and impossible structures that defy the laws of reality. Somewhere inside this labyrinth, an entity known only as Smiles controls the chaos.\n\nBut the anomaly has a darker origin.\n\nThe rift was created by the tortured soul of a boy who died during a classified experiment conducted by T.R.C.O. The weight of his suffering fractured reality itself, creating a gateway where nightmares bleed into the real world.\n\nNow the entity behind the breach has built a maze of hostile dimensions to trap anyone who enters \u2014 and to make the world suffer as he did.\n\nYour mission is clear:\n\nEnter the breach.\nEliminate the threat.\nClose the rift before reality collapses.", "summary": "A reality breach has unleashed something terrible. Fight through 30+ levels, deadly enemies, and brutal boss fights in this 2D top-down horror action game to stop the entity behind the anomaly.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/hostile-entity", "videos": [{"id": 189172, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "jamBoAnCyig", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jamBoAnCyig", "title": "\ud835\udddb\ud835\udde2\ud835\udde6\ud835\udde7\ud835\udddc\ud835\udddf\ud835\uddd8 \ud835\uddd8\ud835\udde1\ud835\udde7\ud835\udddc\ud835\udde7\ud835\uddec - Gameplay Trailer 1", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jamBoAnCyig/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 1891